{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/villagerHug.gif?t=1745570435\" /><strong>Play Werewolf</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Werewolf is a game where a small evil team  try to trick the larger good team. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Good team win by revealing all undercover werewolves. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Evil team win by outnumbering the town.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/workshop.jpg?t=1745570435\" /><strong>Create art and get paid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use our free tools to create art for the game. Vote your favourites on the Steam Workshop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/family.jpg?t=1745570435\" /><strong>Family friendly fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moderated for ages 13 and up. You can lock rooms, filter chat, kick, block and report players. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/loadout.gif?t=1745570435\" /><strong>Express yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dress your character with unique hats, heads and skins. Customise with paint and hair dye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/underline.png?t=1745570435\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <i>How do I get items?</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each week, level up 7 times to get 7 items. Purchases are optional and only cosmetic. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Can I trade or sell my items?</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam accounts that are not limited can trade cosmetics or sell them  on the Steam Community Market to buy other Steam games </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>How can I get paid for my art?</i> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approved items get a cut of every sale, paid securely through Steam. We approve items that follow our style guides and the community rates highly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/underline.png?t=1745570435\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/extras/steampage_socials.jpg?t=1745570435\" /><strong>Follow us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click the buttons on the right to join our community,  follow us for playtest dates and updates! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Make new friends and join our cosy online community for <strong>free.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Club!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1435100?t=1745570435","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745570435","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/ad60a03d738a117f8fb7123b383a4ee77b0bfc82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745570435","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435100/ad60a03d738a117f8fb7123b383a4ee77b0bfc82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745570435","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Works